, 465-491, 505, 525, 638-654`; `PlatoonSim.cpp:56-97` inside `PlanPlatoon`, `:118-131`, `:223-244`. The encounter gate at `BattleSim.cpp:641` allows drills on encounter 0 and 5..7 only. The drills-gated emergency-shelter reservation check goes in `TaskSim.cpp:100-113`. New state: `DrillPlan` appended to `SquadCommand` after `preparedPlatoonSerial` (`BattleSim.h:451`), `PlatoonTaskState` appended to `PlatoonCommand`, fields appended to `SquadSituation`; all default-initialised so existing digests and the test fingerprint are untouched. Every new `Sim/*.cpp` must be added to `scripts/test-sim.sh:7-24`; `tests/drills_tests.h` joins `tests/sim_tests.cpp:743-758`.

